# Copy to .env.local for local development. You normally do not need this file
# at all locally, because `npm run dev` sends /api to localhost:4000 for you.
#
# It matters when the website and the API live at different addresses, which is
# what happens once both are on Vercel. Set this in Vercel's environment
# variables for the website project, to your API project's address plus /api:
#
#   VITE_API_BASE=https://labbook-api.vercel.app/api
#
# Vite reads this at build time, not when the page loads, so changing it in
# Vercel needs a redeploy to take effect.

VITE_API_BASE=
